  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28ec8b4c43df9884dab1e56106bf74dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Run1_Trench
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - speakerProfile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a2a1d452bd23ba24686b0db5bcb460b3, type: 2}
    textOptions:
    - "Look at that corpse. That\u2019s you. Every time you die, I haul another one
      of you into the dirt."
  - speakerProfile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a2a1d452bd23ba24686b0db5bcb460b3, type: 2}
    textOptions:
    - You're a disposable husk, forged by Atlas, the original Caretaker. He's been
      dead for centuries, yet Janus called on him because he's too weak to fight
      this invasion alone
  - speakerProfile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a2a1d452bd23ba24686b0db5bcb460b3, type: 2}
    textOptions:
    - "I\u2019ve spent ages cleaning up their mess. That is my curse. Yours is to
      go die out there. Go on, I sense Milo coming, and my arms are tired."
